ers 120 years into  the fourth age at the ripe old age of  210 years old king alisar  finally dies however he doesn't pass in  his sleep  nor is he killed in battle instead  aragorn willingly gives up his spirit  before he becomes old  and broken it is also explained that  after aragorn's death  arlen went forth from the house and the  light of her eyes was quenched  and it seemed to her people that she had  become cold and gray  as nightfall and winter that comes  without a star the queen then bids  farewell to her children  and travels to la florian all of the  elves have left the golden wood by this  point but she wanders through the empty  land nonetheless  eventually she lies down to rest in the  same spot where she and aragorn had  become  engaged long before there she quietly  dies  and it's said that her green grave will  remain until the world  is changed in gondor eldarian becomes  king  and in a letter written in 1972 tolkien  briefly mentioned that his reign lasts  for roughly  a century i thought i'd die fighting  side by side with a mouth  what about side by side with a friend  after sauron is defeated and the war of  the ring comes to an  end lego lost and gimli stay pretty busy  on their way home from war  these newfound friends first visit the  ensign veingorn and then  aglarond the glittering caves hidden  behind homes deep  afterwards gimli returns to the lonely  mountain  only to find that the war of the ring  has devastated the whole region  eventually he gathers some of his fellow  dwarf folk  and they settle down in aglarond kimley  himself leads the dwarven colony  becoming the lord of the glittering  caves  this relocation puts gimli close to  ministerith  and the return of the king states he and  his people did great works  in gondor and rohan of particular note  they fixed the gates of ministerith  which the witch king's army had smashed  forging the replacement parts out of  steel  and mithril lego lost does his part to  back up aragorn's